- Composer model pill: student build shows Fast/Thinking + effort (Light/
  Balanced/Deep) via new StudentModelMenu; never shows deepseek/provider/model.
- Agent identity -> Nemesis (SOUL.md + default_soul.py + prompt_builder
  DEFAULT_AGENT_IDENTITY): health-student study assistant, evidence+citations,
  drafts-not-submissions, no code framing.
- Hide for students (src/nemesis.ts sets): statusbar version/hash, gateway
  health, context/token meter, YOLO, command-center, agents, cron, terminal;
  palette command-center + gateway + cron/agents/profiles/starmap + git branch
  group (empty groups dropped); sidebar cron section + profile rail.
